&lt;h2&gt;


  The real problem with web agencies in 2026
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I ran paid ads for 8 years. I've seen hundreds of landing pages fail. Here's the pattern:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agency charges $30k for a "brand refresh"&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes 3 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivers a pretty Figma export that doesn't convert&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Charges $300/month retainer forever&lt;/li&gt;
